{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15852","headline":"送皇甫冉往白田 · 崔峒","name":"送皇甫冉往白田","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江边尽日雉鸣飞，君向白田何日归。\n楚地蒹葭连海逈，隋朝杨柳映堤稀。\n津楼故市无行客，山馆空庭闭落晖。\n试问疲人与征战，使君双泪定沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}